# prompt_template.txt is go:embed'd into the exact bytes sent to the model,
# and golden_prompt_test.go compares the rendered prompt byte-for-byte against
# a golden file generated by the Python training corpus (LF). Windows'
# core.autocrlf=true silently rewrites both to CRLF on checkout, which breaks
# that comparison without touching a single line of Go or Python -- pin LF so
# the anti-skew check means what it says regardless of the checkout platform.
internal/advisory/prompt_template.txt text eol=lf
internal/advisory/testdata/*.txt text eol=lf
